   "proposition": "The Japanese says the instructions for building a date sequence with seq.Date() are in the separate 'ggplot basics' chapter; the English says they are in the opening ggplot section of this same page.",
   "reader_consequence": "A Japanese reader leaves the epicurve chapter to look for seq.Date() guidance in a chapter that does not contain it, instead of scrolling up to the 'Specify case bins' section where it is explained.",
